// A symlink named augogen is not the plate directory.
// The read ignores it. The write replaces that link.
// Rank, concept, line, and the store stay.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE dirlink ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law    ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG dirlink law

IMPULSE dirlink 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "dirlink" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
